  <Miho_PositiveFlower_Juice_Addiction.label>秘靈烈藥成癮</Miho_PositiveFlower_Juice_Addiction.label>
  <!-- EN: 태양화 위험약물에 중독되었습니다. -->
  <Miho_PositiveFlower_Juice_Addiction.description>秘靈烈藥的化學成癮。長期飲用秘靈烈藥會造成細胞內的神經適應秘靈烈藥，導致大腦沒有秘靈烈藥的話就無法運作。\n\n如果沒有定期飲用朝花湯劑，戒斷反應就會開始。然而，長時間的戒斷會迫使大腦恢復正常狀態，解決成癮問題。</Miho_PositiveFlower_Juice_Addiction.description>
  <!-- EN: withdrawal -->
  <Miho_PositiveFlower_Juice_Addiction.stages.withdrawal.label>戒斷</Miho_PositiveFlower_Juice_Addiction.stages.withdrawal.label>
  
  <!-- EN: 탕약의 효과 -->
  <Miho_PositiveFlower_Juice_High.label>朝花湯劑效果</Miho_PositiveFlower_Juice_High.label>
  <!-- EN: 탕약의 효능 : 맛없다 -->
  <Miho_PositiveFlower_Juice_High.description>朝花湯劑正在使心靈熵快速消散。順帶一提，這東西可並不怎麽好喝。</Miho_PositiveFlower_Juice_High.description>
  <!-- EN: 탕약의 효과 -->
  <Miho_PositiveFlower_Juice_High.labelNoun>朝花湯劑效果</Miho_PositiveFlower_Juice_High.labelNoun>
  
  <!-- EN: 태양화 위험약물 허용치 -->
  <Miho_PositiveFlower_Juice_Tolerance.label>秘靈烈藥耐受</Miho_PositiveFlower_Juice_Tolerance.label>
  <!-- EN: 태양화 위험약물 -->
  <Miho_PositiveFlower_Juice_Tolerance.description>對秘靈烈藥的耐受性。耐受性越嚴重，達到同樣效果所需要的朝花湯劑也就越多。</Miho_PositiveFlower_Juice_Tolerance.description>
